WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:08.030
Ramachandran trained as a physicist under C. V. Raman and built a new physics

2
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:11.090
department at the University of Madras from almost nothing.

3
00:00:11.933 --> 00:00:17.913
In 1963, with two colleagues, he asked a question no one had put precisely before:

4
00:00:18.653 --> 00:00:24.993
for every amino acid in a chain, which pairs of backbone angles phi and psi are

5
00:00:24.993 --> 00:00:26.993
possible without atoms colliding?

6
00:00:27.783 --> 00:00:32.683
They calculated the allowed distances, shaded the forbidden combinations, and

7
00:00:32.683 --> 00:00:34.943
plotted the result axis by axis.

8
00:00:35.603 --> 00:00:40.983
The survivors clustered into two compact islands one for the alpha helix, one for

9
00:00:40.983 --> 00:00:44.143
the beta sheet with the rest of the plane nearly empty.

10
00:00:45.017 --> 00:00:50.797
60 years on, his plot is the first sanity check run on every new protein structure

11
00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:55.937
in the world. The Nobel Committee never called; the prizes that touched his field

12
00:00:55.937 --> 00:01:02.197
passed him by. He died in Chennai in 2001, after Parkinson's disease and the loss of

13
00:01:02.197 --> 00:01:03.777
his wife of 53 years.
